  {"question": "Can SAB Autopilot handle both weekly and fortnightly employees in the same business?", "answer": "Yes. Each employee has their pay cycle set individually. You can run payroll for just your weekly employees ('Process payroll for the weekly staff') and separately for fortnightly employees the following week. Or run everything together and SAB Autopilot adjusts each payslip to the correct period for that employee's cycle. The confirm card clearly shows the pay period for each employee."},
